---
description: TypeScript, Telegram, and n8n are edges — not a second brain
globs: **/*.ts,**/*.tsx,app/**/*,telegram_ai/**/*,n8n/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

TypeScript/Next.js may present, proxy, and cache canonical state.
It must not create independent investment recommendations.

Do not widen `scoring.ts`, `engine.ts`, `council.ts`, or `alerts.ts`
decision authority. Telegram must use `AHOS_GATEWAY_URL` and must not
import an opportunity scorer. n8n orchestrates; core logic stays in Python.

Escape user-generated and provider HTML before Telegram HTML parse mode.
Never put secrets in client bundles or commit tokens.
Persian UI is RTL; English UI is LTR. Visual/audio effects never encode
hidden authority.
